[{"title":"汉歌","author":"萧贡","text":"华阴双璧传山鬼，报道明年祖龙死。\n草间豪杰伺天时，攘袖抚衿争欲起。\n丛祠篝火妖狐语，夥涉为王张大楚。\n南公旧有三户谣，东井新看五星聚。\n中原茫茫走秦鹿，天遣沛公兴白屋。\n大蛇斩断素灵号，蚩尤祭罢朱旗矗。\n朅来扶义入关中，恩结人心帝道隆。\n秦法烦苛犹一洗，项王剽悍何劳攻。\n三杰相须立人纪，四老仍来安太子。\n已令陆贾说诗书，更诏孙通制仪礼。\n阿翁着手规摹远，独恨儿孙读城旦。\n王纯霸杂宁不知，不是不知知已晚。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1647,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"楚歌","author":"萧贡","text":"沙丘车过亡明镜，人头畜鸣自贤圣。\n阿房殿里醉宫娃，赵高手中持国柄。\n群雄云扰荡山东，邯郸却堕秦围中。\n项王一战动天地，诸侯膝行趋下风。\n割裂河山建侯国，天下畏威心不服。\n只贪衣绣荣楚猴，岂识金刀得秦鹿。\n楚歌一夜四面发，泣别虞姬歌数阕。\n残兵牢落似晨星，独骑凌兢踏寒月。\n乌江渡口方唤船，五侯追奔已江边。\n苦道天亡非战罪，剑化壮气成飞烟。\n君王雄武古无比，独无仁义谁相济。\n向能忠计资范增，未必汉家能卜世。\n谷城东头土一丘，悠悠遗恨何年休。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1648,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"悲长平","author":"萧贡","text":"秦兵伏甲武安西，赵将非材战士携。\n千里阵云沉晓日，万家屋瓦震秋鼙。\n哀缠朽骨天应泣，怨入空山鸟不栖。\n百战区区竟何得，阿房烟草亦凄迷。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1649,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雒阳","author":"萧贡","text":"西来洛水绕崧高，野店荒村换市朝。\n董卓搜牢连数月，郭威夯市又三朝。\n劫灰深掘终难尽，鬼火争然忽自消。\n千古兴亡几春梦，只将閒话付渔樵。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1650,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"中秋对月","author":"萧贡","text":"去年中秋客神京，露坐举杯邀月明。\n今年还对去年月，北风黄草辽西城。\n年年月色长清好，只有悲秋人易老。\n儿童不解忆长安，歌舞团圞绕翁媪。\n人生宦游真可怜，不知何处度明年。\n预愁老罢废诗酒，负此冰玉秋婵娟。\n我生万事随缘耳，居自无忧行亦喜。\n君不见杜子闺中只独看，鄜州寂寞千山里。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1651,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"寄答张维中","author":"萧贡","text":"北辕千里赴陪都，日觉还家计愈疏。\n人事浮云千变化，宦途平地几崎岖。\n青山有约长回首，白发无情忽满梳。\n赖有同年老兄弟，相思时寄数行书。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1652,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"保德州天桥","author":"萧贡","text":"郁郁风云入壮怀，天潢飞下碧崔嵬。\n两崖偪侧无十步，万顷逡巡纳一杯。\n溅沫纷纷跳乱雹，怒涛殷殷转晴雷。\n曾闻电火鱼烧尾，会趁桃花涨水来。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1653,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"灵石县","author":"萧贡","text":"古道行人少，荒城乱石侵。\n天横机素直，河入土囊深。\n涧近云长润，山高日易沈。\n田翁乐丰岁，歌笑下崎嵚。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1654,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"真容院","author":"萧贡","text":"魔宫佛界等空虚，此理何曾属有无。\n直向台山始相见，可中还有二文殊。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1655,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"读火山瑩禅师诗卷","author":"萧贡","text":"长短都归一梦中，身前身后两无穷。\n李憕信士今如在，定向江湖访泽公。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1656,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"君马白","author":"萧贡","text":"我马瘦，君马肥，我马虺隤君马飞。\n彫鞍宝校锦障泥，向风振迅长鸣嘶。\n一朝计落路傍儿，铜鬲为椁薪为衣。\n瘦马虽瘦骨骼奇，古人相马遗毛皮，千金一顾会有期。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1657,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"陈宫词","author":"萧贡","text":"三阁花深白昼迷，酒催狎客赋宫词。\n管弦散落春风外，一曲金钗两鬓垂。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1658,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"岢岚","author":"萧贡","text":"岢岚地势横三汊，河朔城墉挂一箕。\n紫塞高连寒日短，黄榆落尽长年悲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1659,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"按部道中二首 其一","author":"萧贡","text":"窟野河津水没腰，管岑官路雪封条。\n一年乐事能多少，强半光阴马上消。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1660,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"按部道中二首 其二","author":"萧贡","text":"寒城睥睨插山隅，秋半霜风塞草枯。\n月转谯楼天未晓，角声吹彻小单于。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1661,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"日观峰","author":"萧贡","text":"半夜东风搅邓林，三山银阙杳沉沉。\n洪波万里兼天涌，一点金乌出海心。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1662,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"族兄才卿下第后赴宜禄酒官以诗寄之","author":"萧贡","text":"久期老距擅文埸，命压人头可得忙。\n两脚尘泥官业晚，十年灯火夜窗凉。\n霜添老叶山梨紫，雨浥寒花野菊香。\n南北相望无百里，几时尊酒涴离肠。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1663,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"萧贡","text":"丰姿閒淡洗妆慵，眉绿轻颦秀韵重。\n香惹梦魂云漠漠，光摇溪馆月溶溶。\n陈家乐府歌琼树，妃子春愁惨玉容。\n安得能诗韩吏部，郭西同去醉千钟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1664,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"后赵","author":"萧贡","text":"拟伦人物指高光，可笑枭雏不自量。\n正使成名皆竖子，英雄也未到君行。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1665,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"古采莲曲","author":"萧贡","text":"洋洋长江水，渺渺涨平湖。\n田田青茄荷，艳艳红芙蕖。\n酣酣斜日外，苒苒凉风馀。\n茜茜谁家子，袅袅二八初。\n两两并轻舟，笑笑相招呼。\n悠悠波上鸳，泼泼蒲中鱼。\n采采不盈手，依依欲何如。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1666,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟回文四首 其一","author":"萧贡","text":"春波绿处归鸿过，夜月明时飞鹊愁。\n人去附书将恨寄，莫山云断倚高楼。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1667,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟回文四首 其二","author":"萧贡","text":"楼上却来楼下待，晚窗春尽断回肠。\n愁人有说嫌人问，泪洒新诗埽墨香。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1668,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟回文四首 其三","author":"萧贡","text":"风幌半萦香篆细，碧窗斜影月笼纱。\n红灯夜对愁魂梦，老尽春庭满树花。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1669,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"拟回文四首 其四","author":"萧贡","text":"萋萋碧草连天远，杳杳行人几日回。\n凄雨晚凉空坐久，泪妆残晕湿红腮。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1670,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"李雁门","author":"史公奕","text":"天下三分二属梁，区区独木欲支唐。\n锦囊三矢传遗恨，不救朱三着赭黄。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1671,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"雪谷晓装图","author":"庞铸","text":"溪流咽咽山昏昏，前山后山同一云。\n天公谈笑玉雪喷，散为花蕊白纷纷。\n诗翁瘦马之何许，忍冻吟诗太清古。\n老奴寒缩私自语，作奴莫比诗奴苦。\n木僵石老鸟不飞，山路益深诗益奇。\n老奴忍笑怜翁痴，不知嗜好乃尔为。\n杨侯胸中富丘壑，醉里笔端驱雪落。\n因何不把此诗翁，画向草堂深处着。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1672,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"景骨城驿中夜雨","author":"庞铸","text":"画角边城莫，孤舂野水秋。\n一川霜树老，万叶雨声愁。\n自古谁青眼，劳生只白头。\n何时问渔父，容我一扁舟。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1673,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"洛阳怀古","author":"庞铸","text":"草树萧条故苑荒，山川惨淡客魂伤。\n玉光照夜新开冢，剑气沈沙古战场。\n金谷更谁誇富丽，铜驼无处问兴亡。\n一尊且对春风饮，万事从来谷与臧。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1674,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"田器之燕子图　器之自叙云明昌丙辰予从军塞外合虏里山野舍荒凉难以状言春末有双燕亦巢此屋土人不之识屡欲捕之予曲为全护此燕昼出夜归予必开户待之忽一日飞止坐隅都无惊畏巧语移时不去予始悟明日秋社此鸟当归殆留别语也因作一诗赠之云几年塞外历崎危谁谓乌衣亦此飞朝向芦陂知有为莫投茅舍重相依君怜我处频迎语我忆君时不掩扉明日西风悲鼓角君应先去我何归此诗以细字写之为蜡丸系之燕足上明年四月予受代归又八年泰和甲子任潞州观察判","author":"庞铸","text":"田君才略燕云客，少年累有安边策。\n悔从笔砚取功名，直要横驰沙漠北。\n塞垣春雪白皑皑，东风未放玄阴开。\n乌衣之国定何许，一双燕子能飞来。\n三年驿舍安西道，眼底莺花无梦到。\n忽见低飞入短檐，此身似向邯郸觉。\n君居海东我中原，相逢乃在穹庐前。\n天涯流落俱为客，感时念远空潸然。\n长安何限高高阁，昼夜风閒开翠幕。\n底事猜嫌不往依，甘从此地风沙恶。\n土人嗜肉无仁心，一生弋猎誇从禽。\n有巢幸稳勿浪出，汝身未必轻千金。\n朝来暮去益狎昵，物我相忘情意一。\n但怪重裘积渐添，元是西风催社日。\n须知音巧惟鷾鸸，忽来坐隅如告辞。\n我方留寓未归得，为君忍赋伤心诗。\n诗成自述聊为戏，系足封之亦无意。\n燕已归飞我未归，刁斗声中忽惊岁。\n旄头夜落妖氛收，嫖姚献凯归神州。\n玉关早喜班超入，北海不闻苏武留。\n君才经世宁终枉，幕府须贤来上党。\n别后归期两及瓜，人间秋燕日来往。\n沈沈官舍红芳稀，葛衣燕居澹忘机。\n忽闻巧语入檐户，大似相识来相依。\n一飞檐外窥庭树，一上屏山惊不去。\n解足分明得帛书，真是当年留别句。\n天生万物禽最微，固耶偶耶吾不知。\n古道益远交情醨，朝恩莫怨云迁移。\n当时握手悲别离，一旦富贵弃如遗。\n闻予燕歌应自疑，慎无示之嗔我讥。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1675,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"晚秋登城楼二首 其一","author":"庞铸","text":"山势碧环合，溪光缟带明。\n牛羊成晚景，砧杵助秋声。\n酒薄人情废，官閒吏事生。\n天东归兴满，不为忆莼羹。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1676,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"晚秋登城楼二首 其二","author":"庞铸","text":"落日危楼上，诗成只自哦。\n清商行老矣，红叶奈秋何。\n堕甑前非悟，跳丸去日多。\n功名犹诳我，未许著渔蓑。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1677,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"冬夜直宿省中","author":"庞铸","text":"吏散庭空宿鸟过，冻唫聊复战诗魔。\n陶泓面冷真堪唾，毛颖头尖漫费呵。\n畏事政宜宾客少，不才偏觉簿书多。\n西窗灯闇尊无酒，奈此迢迢夜漏何。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1678,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山行绝句","author":"庞铸","text":"四面云山玉作围，一川霜树锦为衣。\n翩翩数骑南冈下，傅粉王孙射鹿归。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1679,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"漉酒图","author":"庞铸","text":"我爱陶渊明，爱酒不爱官。\n弹琴但寓意，把酒聊开颜。\n自得酒中趣，岂问头上冠。\n谁作漉酒图，清风起毫端。\n露电出形似，神情想高閒。\n大似挥弦时，目送飞鸿难。\n袖中有东篱，开卷见南山。\n嗟予困尘土，青鬓时一斑。\n折腰尚未免，敢谓善闭关。\n望望孤云翔，羡羡飞鸟还。\n归田未有日，掩卷空长叹。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1680,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"夏日","author":"庞铸","text":"富国才疏合自羞，清时无补但优游。\n只知钱向纸中裹，不信能教地上流。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1681,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"花下","author":"庞铸","text":"香满西园晓雨微，万红千翠自高低。\n若为常作庄周梦，飞向幽芳闹处栖。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1682,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"庞铸","text":"孤洁本无匹，谁令先众芳。\n花能红处白，月共冷时香。\n缟袂清无染，冰姿淡不妆。\n夜来清露底，万颗玉毫光。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1683,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"未开牡丹","author":"庞铸","text":"国香半吐醉颜酡，炫耀春工已自多。\n爱惜不教催羯鼓，更浇卯酒看如何。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1684,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"却暑","author":"庞铸","text":"九夏楼居不厌高，更须直至冷云巢。\n风来蘋末聊自快，暑满人间无处逃。\n蔗蜜浆寒冰皎皎，画帘钩冷月梢梢。\n閒思殿阁生凉句，谁为诚悬作解嘲。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1685,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"庞铸","text":"镜里衰颜失旧红，当年豪逸梦魂中。\n山城对月中秋夜，陇雁寄书西北风。\n遣兴与谁同酒盏，相思无处附诗筒。\n凭高想到消䰟处，落日无言水自东。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1686,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"喜夏","author":"庞铸","text":"小暑不足畏，深居如退藏。\n青奴初荐枕，黄妳亦升堂。\n鸟语竹阴密，雨声荷叶香。\n晚窗无一事，步屧到西厢。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1687,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"墨竹三首 其一","author":"庞铸","text":"一溪流水玉涓涓，溪上修篁接莫烟。\n谁倩能诗文与可，笔端移得小江天。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1688,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"墨竹三首 其二","author":"庞铸","text":"瀰川急雨暗秋空，无限琅玕澹墨中。\n剑甲摐摐军十万，欲将貔虎战斜风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1689,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"墨竹三首 其三","author":"庞铸","text":"千梢万叶玉玲珑，枯槁丛边绿转浓。\n待得春雷惊蛰起，此中应有葛陂龙。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1690,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"山谷透绢帖","author":"庞铸","text":"君不见李广射虎如射兔，霹雳一声石饮羽。\n又不见巨灵擘山如擘云，莲华万仞留掌痕。\n精神入物物乃尔，笔端有神亦如此。\n熙丰以来推善书，日下无双黄太史。\n胸中八法蟠虹霓，峨眉仙人容并驰。\n平生败笔冢累累，妙处不减磨崖碑。\n吕侯好古兼好异，与字分身作游戏。\n清潭错落印星璧，大泽纵横散龙蜕。\n又如汉宫粉黛争婵娟，倚风顾影影更妍。\n岂无硬黄官纸与临仿，画师写照非天然。\n吕侯之子今诗仙，传家以此为青毡。\n须防神物有时合，却逐六丁飞上天。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1691,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"青柯平二道人","author":"许古","text":"深谷缘危磴，长林绕碧山。\n山中四时好，方外两翁閒。\n身世青云上，尘埃大梦间。\n高情应笑我，才到却空还。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1692,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"被召过少室","author":"许古","text":"老病无堪合退休，伊川久巳得菟裘。\n如今又上长安道，好被青山笑白头。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1693,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"扇图","author":"许古","text":"云压溪塘小雪春，融融和气浥轻尘。\n山禽共作梅花梦，物性由来懒是真。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1694,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"访箕和尚岘山","author":"许古","text":"山中风定夜沈沈，月满禅林静客心。\n苍桧四排严法界，孤松中立殷潮音。\n鼓钟有节人如玉，台殿无尘地布金。\n二月来游春尚浅，红梅无数照山阴。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1695,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"送任李二生赴举","author":"王良臣","text":"尘涩鳌钩公子恨，风吹马耳谪仙愁。\n皇天老眼成人晚，今日男儿得志秋。\n官样文章堆笔底，世情风色候江头。\n主司不是冬烘物，五色迷人莫浪忧。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1696,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"汴堤怀古","author":"王良臣","text":"迷仙楼观郁连空，一日都归鬼唾中。\n奢则兆亡天听迩，去而不返水声东。\n锁烟弱柳愁蛾绿，阁雨幽花泪脸红。\n总为锦帆归不得，至今啼鸟怨东风。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1697,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"旬休饮","author":"王良臣","text":"袅袅东风雪外还，又催春色动溪山。\n百年莫作千年调，十日须谋一日閒。\n千丈归心诗卷里，一襟豪气酒杯间。\n醉鞭约住黄昏月，马首低悬玉半环。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1698,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"息轩","author":"王良臣","text":"乾没皇皇西复东，不知假息祸机中。\n黄金一旦随胠箧，腐骨千年付攓蓬。\n世味甜于刀上蜜，人心苦似蓼中虫。\n一庵松雪双明底，笑杀西山槁项翁。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1699,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"九月七日饮","author":"王良臣","text":"紫霞零落带孤禽，平楚苍苍秋意深。\n月过初三半梳玉，菊迎重九满篱金。\n天怜病骨商量暖，云促归程计会阴。\n风雁飞来更潇洒，一枝芦雪印波心。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1700,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"牧牛图","author":"王良臣","text":"三摩不受一尘侵，本分功夫日念深。\n杖屦得回游子脚，葛藤灰尽老㜑心。\n颠狂不作风头絮，出入谁伤井底金。\n回首人牛在何许，一江明月夜沈沈。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1701,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"狸奴画轴","author":"王良臣","text":"三生白老与乌员，又现吴生小笔前。\n乞与黄家禳鼠祸，莫教虚费买鱼钱。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1702,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杂诗三首 其一","author":"王良臣","text":"道人知我爱禅房，净埽阶前紫石床。\n软饱三杯风味好，脱巾和月卧昏黄。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1703,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杂诗三首 其二","author":"王良臣","text":"老子平生酷爱閒，天教行处得禅关。\n粥鱼敲落檐头月，犹在梅花醉梦间。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1704,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"杂诗三首 其三","author":"王良臣","text":"残阳收拾弟兄行，拣得机心不到卿。\n安置小奴今夜梦，芦花风细月如霜。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1705,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"天津桥同李之纯待月一首","author":"高廷玉","text":"骖鸾追散仙，乘槎抵银潢。\n跳上玉龙背，抱得银蟾光。\n素娥愁不归，再拜捧瑶觞。\n问以天上事，玉色俨以庄。\n尔能为我歌白雪，我亦为尔捣玄霜。\n不然借我广寒殿，与我长作无何乡。\n傍有谪仙人，拍手笑我狂。\n天风忽吹散，人月两茫茫。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1706,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"高廷玉","text":"断送春归去，纷飞不暂停。\n和风三径雪，微雨一池萍。\n蝶惹依芳草，蜂沾过小庭。\n静宜投隙地，狂欲搅青冥。\n得得穿朱户，时时扑翠屏。\n黄莺枝上语，似与诉飘零。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1707,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"道出平州寒食忆家","author":"高廷玉","text":"柳色方浓别玉京，程程又值石龟城。\n山重水复人千里，月苦风酸雁一声。\n上国春风桃叶渡，东阳寒食杏花饧。\n楚魂蜀魄偏相妒，两地悠悠寄此情。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1708,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}},{"title":"飞山怨","author":"高廷玉","text":"汉家自有飞将军，军中骇叹箭有神。\n一朝乃与狱吏对，惜无千金书牍背。\n手把属镂口衔须，号天者三我何辜。\n伊吾壮志长已矣，不得提携玉龙死。\n可怜休唱白浮鸠，至今秦人悲杜邮。","collection":"金","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金.csv","pointer":1709,"sha256":"724ca7dd3a8c08bfe97f7192826eb2a445ec85c4fac0eab34147ef577ba45ec0","dynasty":"金"}}]